# How to cite this plugin. GitHub shows a "Cite this repository" button from it.
# Update "version" and "date-released" with each release.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this plugin in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Satellite Downloader: a QGIS plugin for registration-free satellite data"
abstract: >-
  QGIS plugin that searches public STAC catalogues and bundled indexes of static
  catalogues for an area and date range, reads cloud-optimised GeoTIFFs only where
  they overlap the area, and mosaics, stacks and clips them. No account or API key
  is needed.
authors:
  - family-names: Handy
    given-names: Dennis
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/d-handy/qgis-satellite-downloader"
version: 0.5.0
date-released: "2026-11-22"
keywords:
  - QGIS
  - remote sensing
  - STAC
  - Sentinel
  - Landsat
  - cloud-optimised GeoTIFF
